---
layout: base.njk
description: Evie (Yuxin) Hou — sociology, AI systems, research infrastructure, projects and notes.
---
{% from 'entries.njk' import entryList %}
<section class="intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
  <h1 id="intro-title">Yuxin Hou <span lang="zh-CN">侯煜欣</span></h1>
  <p>{{ portfolio.intro }}</p>
  <p class="academic-role">{{ portfolio.role }}</p>
  <div class="intro-links"><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email</a><a href="{{ site.github }}">GitHub</a><a href="/about/">About</a></div>
</section>
<section class="assistant-panel" aria-labelledby="assistant-title">
  <div class="assistant-heading"><h2 id="assistant-title">Portfolio assistant</h2><span id="assistant-mode" class="mode-label">Local demo</span></div>
  <p id="greeting">Ask about my background, projects, or research interests.</p>
  <div id="conversation" class="conversation" role="log" aria-label="Portfolio conversation" aria-live="polite" aria-relevant="additions"></div>
  <form id="chat-form"><label class="sr-only" for="question">Ask about Evie or her projects</label><div class="chat-input"><input id="question" name="question" placeholder="Ask a question about my work" maxlength="400" required autocomplete="off"><button type="submit">Send</button></div></form>
  <div class="suggestions"><span>Try:</span><button type="button" data-question="Tell me about SSDataAgent">SSDataAgent</button><button type="button" data-question="Tell me about Mind Imprint">Mind Imprint</button><button type="button" data-question="Tell me about Evie">Background</button></div>
  <p id="chat-status" class="source-note" role="status">Curated answers, not live AI. Nothing you type is sent or saved.</p>
  <div id="live-options" class="live-options" hidden>
    <label><input id="live-consent" type="checkbox"> Use live AI: send my submitted questions and a time-of-day category to this site’s server and DeepSeek. Don’t include private information. Provider retention policies apply.</label>
    <div><button id="enable-live" type="button">Connect to live AI</button><button id="enable-demo" type="button">Use local demo</button></div>
  </div>
  <details class="privacy-details"><summary>Sources and privacy</summary><p>This AI portfolio assistant uses only the reviewed public facts on this site. The current local demo uses topic matching, not a language model. Optional live mode requires explicit opt-in. Neither mode has access to private files, account credentials, location, or chat history.</p><a href="/about/#sources">Read the source and privacy notes</a></details>
  <noscript><p>The interactive guide requires JavaScript. All profile information and source links are available below.</p></noscript>
</section>
<section id="projects" class="home-section">
  <div class="section-heading"><h2>Selected projects</h2><a href="/projects/">All projects</a></div>
  <p class="section-intro">Selected from public GitHub repositories for their relevance to social research, applied AI, and reproducible systems.</p>
  {% include 'project-cards.njk' %}
  {% set projects = entries | section('projects') | selected %}
  {% if projects.length %}{{ entryList(projects, 'h3') }}{% else %}<p class="empty-state">Detailed project case studies are being prepared.</p>{% endif %}
</section>
<section id="interests" class="home-section">
  <div class="section-heading"><h2>Background and interests</h2><a href="/about/">About</a></div>
  <p class="section-intro">{{ portfolio.approach }}</p>
  <dl class="milestone-table"><dt>Peking University</dt><dd>Third-year Sociology PhD student.</dd><dt>Princeton University</dt><dd>One-year Visiting Student Research Collaborator.</dd></dl>
  <p class="source-note">Academic status supplied by Evie. Exact dates have not been supplied, so these entries are not plotted on a calendar or a life-status scale.</p>
  <details class="radar-details"><summary>Domain profile: illustrative sketch, awaiting self-assessment</summary>
    <p class="source-note">All scores are editable placeholders, not assessments of proficiency. Changes last only until reload.</p>
    <div class="radar-layout">
      <svg id="radar" viewBox="0 0 380 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="radar-title radar-desc"><title id="radar-title">Illustrative domain radar</title><desc id="radar-desc">Placeholder values from 0 to 5; not Evie’s ratings.</desc><g id="radar-grid"></g><polygon id="radar-shape" points="" fill="#285a83" fill-opacity=".1" stroke="#285a83" stroke-width="1.5"></polygon><g id="radar-labels"></g></svg>
      <div class="score-editor">{% for domain in portfolio.domains %}<label>{{ domain }} <input type="range" min="0" max="5" step="1" value="{{ portfolio.illustrativeScores[loop.index0] }}" data-domain="{{ loop.index0 }}"><output>{{ portfolio.illustrativeScores[loop.index0] }}/5</output></label>{% endfor %}<button id="reset-radar" type="button">Reset placeholders</button></div>
    </div>
  </details>
</section>
<section class="home-section">
  <div class="section-heading"><h2>Notes and technical reports</h2><a href="/reports/">All reports</a></div>
  {% set reports = entries | section('reports') | firstEntries %}
  {% if reports.length %}{{ entryList(reports, 'h3') }}{% else %}<p class="empty-state">No notes or technical reports published yet.</p>{% endif %}
</section>
<script type="module" src="/assets/portfolio.js"></script>
